,"bottom":"50","left":"10","isLinked":false},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"4677bad"}]},"elements":[{"id":"1dbc59f9","settings":{"title":"Signs It Is Time To Replace Your Air Conditioner","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Como-ExtraBold","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":60,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":40,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"800","typography_text_transform":"capitalize","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.1000000000000001,"sizes":[]},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"279d6a3"}],"_animation":"zoomIn","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"45a609a8","settings":{"editor":"<p>An old air conditioner rarely becomes unreliable all at once. In many cases, the warning signs build slowly. Your system may still turn on, but it may run longer, cool less evenly, and use more energy than it should.<\/p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"BeVietnamPro-Light","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","_padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"10","right":"10","bottom":"10","left":"10","isLinked":true},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"ab32aea"}],"__globals__":{"text_color":"globals\/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"6e79bfa5","settings":{"editor":"<p>You may need AC replacement if you are noticing:<\/p><ul><li>Frequent AC repairs<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/magnoliaairllc.com\/high-electric-bills-from-ac\/\">Rising energy bills<\/a><\/li><li>Warm air or uneven cooling<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/magnoliaairllc.com\/troubleshooting-poor-airflow-from-ac-vents\/\">Weak airflow<\/a> throughout your home<\/li><li><a href=\"https:\/\/magnoliaairllc.com\/how-to-reduce-ac-humidity-problems\/\">Excess indoor humidity<\/a><\/li><li>Loud or unusual system noises<\/li><li>Repeated breakdowns during hot weather<\/li><li>An AC system that is 10 to 15 years old or older<\/li><li>Expensive repairs involving major components<\/li><li>Difficulty finding parts or refrigerant for an older unit<\/li><\/ul>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"BeVietnamPro-Light","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"400","_padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"10","right":"10","bottom":"10","left":"10","isLinked":true},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"ab32aea"}],"__globals__":{"text_color":"globals\/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"332469e2","settings":{"editor":"<p>In Dry Prong and across Central Louisiana, air conditioners work hard through long cooling seasons and heavy humidity. That extra demand can accelerate wear on older systems, especially units that have not been maintained consistently.<\/p><p>Replacing an aging system before it completely fails can help you avoid emergency breakdowns, repeated repair costs, and uncomfortable downtime when your home or business needs cooling most.<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"b564100"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"7365c2c","settings":{"title":"Replace Your AC Before It Fails Completely","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Como-ExtraBold","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":60,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":40,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"800","typography_text_transform":"capitalize","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.1000000000000001,"sizes":[]},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"279d6a3"}],"_animation":"zoomIn","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"fd362f","settings":{"editor":"<p>Many homeowners wait until their air conditioner stops working entirely before thinking about replacement. While that is understandable, it can leave you with fewer options, more stress, and limited time to make an informed decision.<\/p><p>If your AC is still running but no longer performing well, that may be the best time to start planning. <a href=\"https:\/\/magnoliaairllc.com\/ac-lifespan-maintenance-guide\/\">Replacing an aging system<\/a> before it completely fails gives you the opportunity to choose the right solution instead of rushing into a decision during peak summer heat.<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"f2a5b9d"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"74d3a353","settings":{"title":"Before Peak Summer: Avoid Emergency Replacement Pressure","header_size":"h3","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"ad46eff"}],"__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=secondary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"6efafd0e","settings":{"editor":"<p>Scheduling an AC replacement consultation before the hottest months arrive gives you time to evaluate your system, compare efficiency options, and prepare your home for the cooling season ahead.<\/p><p>Planning replacement early can help you:<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"34d3241"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"663eb5ef","settings":{"editor":"<ul><li><strong>Avoid Repeated Repair Costs:<\/strong> If your system needs frequent service, those repair bills can add up quickly. Replacement may provide better long-term value than continuing to invest in an aging unit.<\/li><li><strong>Improve Cooling Performance:<\/strong> A properly selected replacement system can provide more consistent cooling from room to room, stronger airflow, and better comfort during Louisiana\u2019s hottest months.<\/li><li><strong>Improve Humidity Control:<\/strong> For homeowners in Dry Prong and nearby Central Louisiana communities, humidity control is especially important. If your current AC runs constantly but your home still feels sticky, clammy, or unevenly cooled, your system may no longer be removing moisture effectively.<\/li><li><strong>Lower Energy Waste: <\/strong>Older systems often use more energy to deliver less cooling. A newer, more efficient replacement air conditioner may help reduce monthly utility costs while easing strain on your system.<\/li><li><strong>Reduce Breakdown Risk:<\/strong> Replacing a failing AC before peak summer can help you avoid being left without cooling during extreme Louisiana heat. It can also reduce the stress of unexpected repair calls and give you more dependable performance when your system matters most.<\/li><li><strong>Enjoy Quieter, More Reliable Operation:<\/strong> Aging units often become louder and less predictable over time. A new AC replacement can help improve day-to-day comfort with quieter operation and fewer disruptions.<\/li><\/ul>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"40c0053"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"1e94e5c5","settings":{"editor":"<p>A properly selected AC replacement is not only about getting rid of an old system. It is about improving the way your home feels, performs, and handles the demands of Central Louisiana weather.<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"d1b2edf"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"1eea4c80","settings":{"title":"Choosing The Right Replacement AC For Louisiana Homes","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Como-ExtraBold","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":60,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":40,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"800","typography_text_transform":"capitalize","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.1000000000000001,"sizes":[]},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"279d6a3"}],"_animation":"zoomIn","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"68424367","settings":{"container_type":"grid","presetTitle":"Grid","presetIcon":"eicon-container-grid","content_width":"full","grid_columns_grid":{"unit":"fr","size":2,"sizes":[]},"grid_rows_grid":{"unit":"fr","size":1,"sizes":[]},"_flex_align_self":"center","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"4d47401"}]},"elements":[{"id":"43da9686","settings":{"editor":"<p>Choosing a replacement system is not just about picking a new unit. The right AC should match your home, comfort goals, efficiency needs, and budget.<\/p><p>When helping you compare AC replacement options,<\/p><p>Magnolia Air considers:<\/p><ul><li>Home or business size<\/li><li>Existing ductwork condition<\/li><li>Cooling demand<\/li><li>Indoor humidity concerns<\/li><li>Energy efficiency goals<\/li><li>System age and repair history<\/li><li>Comfort issues in specific rooms<\/li><li>Budget and financing needs<\/li><\/ul>","_flex_align_self":"center","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"c674808"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"1601703f","settings":{"image":{"url":"https:\/\/magnoliaairllc.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/79231.jpg","id":13561,"size":"","alt":"AC","source":"library"},"image_size":"full","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"ca7807d"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"image","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"1873da18","settings":{"editor":"<p>Bigger is not always better. An oversized system can cool too quickly without removing enough humidity, while an undersized system may run constantly and struggle to keep up. In Central Louisiana\u2019s hot and humid climate, proper system selection matters.<\/p><p>Our team helps you understand your options clearly, so you can choose a replacement cooling system that supports long-term comfort and efficiency.<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"165c689"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"89d1cb7","settings":{"text":"Find the Perfect AC Unit for Your Space","align":"justify","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"BeVietnamPro-ExtraBold","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":22,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"500","hover_color":"#FFFFFF","hover_animation":"shrink","border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"50","right":"50","bottom":"50","left":"50","isLinked":true},"text_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"18","right":"18","bottom":"18","left":"18","isLinked":false},"_element_width":"initial","_element_custom_width":{"unit":"px","size":363},"_flex_align_self":"center","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"713e9df"}],"custom_css":".elementor-nav-menu__align-justify .elementor-nav-menu--layout-horizontal .elementor-nav-menu>li:before{\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    background: #fff;\n    height: 8px;\n    width: 8px;\n    border-radius: 50px;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 0;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n}\n.elementor-nav-menu__align-justify .elementor-nav-menu--layout-horizontal .elementor-nav-menu>li:nth-child(1):before{\n    display: none;\n}","__globals__":{"button_background_hover_color":"globals\/colors?id=primary","button_text_color":"globals\/colors?id=1d0e19b5","border_color":"globals\/colors?id=secondary","button_hover_border_color":"globals\/colors?id=primary","background_color":"globals\/colors?id=secondary"},"border_border":"solid","border_width":{"unit":"px","top":"3","right":"3","bottom":"3","left":"3","isLinked":true},"typography_text_transform":"capitalize","link":{"url":"https:\/\/magnoliaairllc.com\/contact-us\/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"_flex_size":"none"},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"button","elType":"widget"},{"id":"140364f3","settings":{"title":"What To Expect During An AC Replacement Consultation","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Como-ExtraBold","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":60,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":40,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"800","typography_text_transform":"capitalize","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.1000000000000001,"sizes":[]},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"279d6a3"}],"_animation":"zoomIn","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"2044fa64","settings":{"editor":"<p>When you contact Magnolia Air for AC replacement, our goal is to help you make a clear, informed decision. We do not believe in pushing a new system <a href=\"https:\/\/magnoliaairllc.com\/ac-repair\/\">when a repair still makes sense<\/a>. We evaluate your current equipment, your comfort concerns, and your long-term goals before recommending a solution.<\/p><p>During your replacement consultation, you can expect:<\/p><ul><li>A full review of your current AC system<\/li><li>Evaluation of system age, repair history, and performance<\/li><li>Assessment of your home or business comfort needs<\/li><li>Review of airflow, ductwork condition, and cooling demand<\/li><li>Clear explanation of replacement options<\/li><li>Guidance on efficiency ratings and system features<\/li><li>Honest recommendations based on budget, comfort, and long-term value<\/li><li>Free estimates for AC replacement and related cooling services<\/li><\/ul><p>Our technicians take the time to answer your questions so you understand not just what system may work best, but why it makes sense for your property.<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"f384e0b"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":false,"elType":"container"},{"id":"2737c10c","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"50","right":"10","bottom":"50","left":"10","isLinked":false},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"4677bad"}]},"elements":[{"id":"760eaa70","settings":{"title":"Our Work Backed by Skilled Service & Honest Guidance","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Como-ExtraBold","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":60,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_tablet":{"unit":"px","size":40,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":30,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"800","typography_text_transform":"capitalize","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.1000000000000001,"sizes":[]},"display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"279d6a3"}],"_animation":"zoomIn","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":fals