status":"subscriber","_id":"e36b835"}]},"elements":[{"id":"664694f1","settings":{"editor":"<p>Yes, the right replacement system can help improve humidity control, especially in Central Louisiana\u2019s hot and humid climate. If your current system leaves your home feeling sticky or uncomfortable even while running, it may no longer be removing moisture effectively.<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"d1717f7"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container","isLocked":true},{"id":"6a32c8b4","settings":{"_title":"item #3","content_width":"full","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"eb8eb98"}]},"elements":[{"id":"1805fe8a","settings":{"editor":"<p>Before replacing your AC, consider your current system\u2019s age, repair history, energy costs, comfort issues, humidity control, and long-term budget. A professional evaluation can help you compare replacement options and choose a system that fits your home or business needs.<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"3168347"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container","isLocked":true},{"id":"62dfab2c","settings":{"_title":"item #3","content_width":"full","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"eb8eb98"}]},"elements":[{"id":"161149e2","settings":{"editor":"<p>Most consultations can be completed in one visit, depending on the condition of your current system and the needs of your home or business. A technician will inspect your equipment, review comfort concerns, and explain replacement options clearly before any decisions are made.<\/p>","display_condition_list":[{"display_condition_login_status":"subscriber","_id":"3168347"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":